---
import { challenges } from '~/lib/site';

const flows = ['Identified attacks · quantified risks', 'Risk & security requirements · mitigation algorithms'];
---

<figure class="fw" aria-labelledby="fw-caption">
  <div class="fw__band">
    <span class="fw__band-title">AAM and UTM system architectures</span>
    <span class="fw__io mono"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> current architecture design</span>
    <span class="fw__io mono"><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span> vulnerabilities and updates</span>
  </div>

  <div class="fw__core">
    <div class="fw__tcs">
      {
        challenges.map((tc, i) => (
          <>
            <section class="fw__tc">
              <p class="fw__code mono">{tc.id}</p>
              <h3>{tc.heading}</h3>
              <ol role="list">
                {tc.tasks.map((task, j) => (
                  <li>
                    <span class="mono">
                      {i + 1}.{j + 1}
                    </span>
                    {task}
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ol>
            </section>
            {i < flows.length && (
              <p class="fw__flow mono">
                <span class="fw__arrow" aria-hidden="true" />
                {flows[i]}
              </p>
            )}
          </>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <p class="fw__return mono"><span aria-hidden="true">↺</span> System-level security guarantees feed back to TC1 and TC2</p>

    <div class="fw__loop mono" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>prototypes →</span>
      <span>← feedback</span>
    </div>

    <section class="fw__vd">
      <p class="fw__code mono">V&amp;D</p>
      <h3>Validation and demonstration</h3>
      <ul role="list">
        <li>Simulation testing</li>
        <li>Hardware testbeds</li>
        <li>Integrated live-virtual-constructive demonstrations</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="fw__band">
    <span class="fw__band-title">CNS infrastructure and avionics standards</span>
    <span class="fw__io mono"><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span> existing standards and constraints</span>
    <span class="fw__io mono"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> security needs for updated standards</span>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="fw-caption">
    The three integrated technical challenges, their task-level interdependencies, and their interaction with
    validation and demonstration, between today's airspace architectures and the standards that govern them.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fw {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .fw__band {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2);
    background: var(--bg-sunken);
  }
  .fw__band-title {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .fw__io {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .fw__io span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .fw__core {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-3);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .fw__core {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 88px 260px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .fw__tcs,
    .fw__return {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
    .fw__loop {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    }
    .fw__vd {
      grid-column: 3;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    }
  }

  .fw__tcs {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .fw__tcs {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 72px minmax(0, 1fr) 72px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
    }
  }
  .fw__tc,
  .fw__vd {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-content: start;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2);
    background: var(--bg-raised);
  }
  .fw__vd {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .fw__code {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .fw h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .fw ol,
  .fw ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .fw ol li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
  }
  .fw ol .mono {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding-top: 0.12rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .fw ul li::before {
    content: '▸ ';
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .fw__flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .fw__arrow::before {
    content: '↓';
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .fw__flow {
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 var(--space-2);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .fw__arrow::before {
      content: '→';
    }
  }

  .fw__return {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .fw__return span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .fw__loop {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .fw__loop {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    max-width: 80ch;
  }
</style>
